              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyo gihe nsubizwamo ubwenge, ubwiza burabagirana nahoranye bungarukamo, butuma ubwami bwanjye bugira icyubahiro. Maze abajyanama banjye n'abatware banjye baza kunshaka, mperako nkomezwa mu bwami bwanjye ndetse nongerwa icyubahiro cyinshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
