        {
          "text": "None jyewe Nebukadinezari ndashimisha Umwami wo mu ijuru, ndamusingiza, ndamwubaha kuko imirimo ye yose ari iy'ukuri kandi inzira ze ari izigororotse, ariko abibone abasha kubacisha bugufi.",
